# Kiosk wall is read-only

The wall is a read-only glance driven by the Daily Plan. It is not:

- A second Notion
- A four-widget dashboard
- A voice-first interface (that was deprecated)
- An interactive control surface

Do not add features, redesign the layout, or put the OpenClaw transcript back on the wall without explicit owner approval.

Changes that look like a redesign or new surface: confirm with the owner first.
